six unique characters, each designed to suit a different archetype of play, such as Striker or Zoner. Learn the ins and outs your favorite characters' moveset and characteristics to find a way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Rules and Party Modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add the chaos? Enable game rules like stage hazards that create new strategies; moveset randomization to keep everyone guessing the whole way through; change the default team size or form a team with a friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Theme Music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own theme track to enjoy! Select the BGM yourself in Free Battle mode or let the automatic system pick a track fitting the upcoming battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984630/extras/6f9eae175e4f19023a0a962251a7af74.poster.avif?t=1739361504\" width=798 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984630/extras/6f9eae175e4f19023a0a962251a7af74.webm?t=1739361504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984630/extras/6f9eae175e4f19023a0a962251a7af74.mp4?t=1739361504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gamepad recommended.</i></p>",
